[N 55-60 17 Blackrock Depths][GL OFF]
[D RestedXP Forever dungeon quest guides: pick up and complete all quests for one dungeon. Converted from the RestedXP guide for Guidelime. Start at level 55 or higher for all required pickups.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]You will now fly around to accept quests for Blackrock Depths. \\ Blackrock Depths is a very convoluted dungeon. In order to complete all quests in the most efficient way, it is required to leave the dungeon midrun to turn in/accept follow up quests so it may all be completed in 1 run. \\ Try to ensure all party members have the same quests and prequests complete, along with 2-3 hours of playtime.
[OC]Remember to take out *Black Dragonflight Molt* from your bank if you completed the quest in Searing Gorge for it earlier. You will need it shortly \\ Collect [CI10575,1]
[OC]Travel to Ironforge
[G 18.1,51.6 Ironforge]Talk to *Innkeeper Firebrew* \\ If you have a Mage in your group you will set your Hearth to Lakeshire instead \\ Set your Hearthstone to [S Ironforge][TAR5111-]
[G 39.09,56.19 Ironforge]Talk to *King Magni Bronzebeard* \\ Accept [QA4341 Kharan Mighthammer]
[OC][L 75.77,23.39 Ironforge]Talk to *Laris Geardawdle* \\ Turn in [QT4513 A Little Slime Goes a Long Way]
[OC]Travel to Kharanos
[G 46.83,52.36 Dun Morogh]Talk to *Ragnar Thunderbrew* \\ Accept [QA4126 Hurley Blackbreath]
[OC][L 21.71,44.8 Redridge Mountains]If your Blackrock Depths group has a Mage, fly to Lakeshire and set your Hearthstone to [S Lakeshire] at *Innkeeper Brianna*. Otherwise, keep your Ironforge bind.[TAR6727-]
[G 84.33,68.33,100 Burning Steppes]Fly from your nearest flight master to Morgan's Vigil in the Burning Steppes.
[G 84.55,68.68 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Oralius* \\ Accept [QA4286 The Good Stuff]
[G 84.74,69.02 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Marshal Maxwell* \\ If you cannot accept this quest complete the Dragonkin Menace quest chain \\ Accept [QA4241 Marshal Windsor]
[G 85.41,70.06 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Jalinda Sprig* \\ Accept [QA4262 Overmaster Pyron]
[A IT10575][G 95.06,31.56 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Cyrus Therepentous* \\ Select the option: "I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus." \\ Accept [QA4022 A Taste of Flame] \\ Turn in [QT4022 A Taste of Flame]
[O][L 95.06,31.56 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Cyrus Therepentous* \\ If you are missing the *Black Dragonflight Molt* and cannot complete the quest, talk to *Cyrus* and select the option: "I do not possess any proof, Cyrus." \\ This will spawn a level 54 Elite Dragon at the entrance of the small cave. Ensure you have party members with you to help kill it, then loot it for the *Black Dragonflight Molt* \\ Select the option after: "I present you with proof of my deeds, Cyrus." \\ Collect 1x *Black Dragonflight Molt* \\ Accept [QA4023 A Taste of Flame] \\ Turn in [QT4023 A Taste of Flame]
[O][L 95.06,31.56 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Cyrus Therepentous* \\ Accept [QA4024 A Taste of Flame] \\ (Only if you turned in the previous part)
[G 65.15,23.91 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Maxwort Uberglint* \\ Accept [QA4123 The Heart of the Mountain]
[G 66.06,21.95 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Yuka Screwspigot* \\ Accept [QA4136 Ribbly Screwspigot]
[A Softcore][G 28.98,28.91 Burning Steppes]Die intentionally in the lava in Blackrock Mountain, ideally near the Molten Core entrance location \\ For this step you must be a *Ghost* to talk to *Franclorn Forgewright* inside Blackrock Mountain. Resurrect at your corpse once you have the quest \\ Talk to *Franclorn Forgewright* \\ Accept [QA3801 Dark Iron Legacy] \\ Turn in [QA3801-][QT3801 Dark Iron Legacy] \\ Accept [QA3802 Dark Iron Legacy]
[A Hardcore][OC][G 29.37,28.29 Burning Steppes]Go to the marked location
[A Hardcore][OC][L 29.37,28.29 Burning Steppes]Click the *Brazier of Embersight* to gain the *Emberglow Vision* debuff
[A Hardcore][G 28.98,28.91 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Franclorn Forgewright* \\ You must have the *Emberglow Vision* debuff to see him \\ Accept [QA3801 Dark Iron Legacy] \\ Turn in [QT3801 Dark Iron Legacy] \\ Accept [QA3802 Dark Iron Legacy]
[G 26.4,24.45 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Lothos Riftwaker* \\ Accept [QA7848 Attunement to the Core]
Kill *Overmaster Pyron* \\ *Overmaster Pyron* patrols outside of the BRD instance portal \\ [QC4262,1 Overmaster Pyron]
Enter Blackrock Depths. Tick this step when you are inside.
[O]Kill *Dwarves* inside of BRD. Loot them for their *Dark Iron Fanny Packs* \\ [QC4286,1 The Good Stuff]
Talk to *Kharan Mighthammer* \\ If your group does not have a Rogue you may need to kill *High Interrogator Gerstahn* for the *Prison Cell Key* to open the doors \\ Turn in [QT4341 Kharan Mighthammer] \\ Accept [QA4342 Kharan's Tale]
Talk to *Kharan Mighthammer* \\ [QC4342,1 Kharan's Tale]
Talk to *Kharan Mighthammer* \\ Turn in [QT4342 Kharan's Tale] \\ Accept [QA4361 The Bearer of Bad News]
Talk to *Marshal Windsor* \\ If your group does not have a Rogue you may need to kill *High Interrogator Gerstahn* for the *Prison Cell Key* to open the doors \\ Turn in [QT4241 Marshal Windsor] \\ Accept [QA4242 Abandoned Hope]
[OC]Hearth to Ironforge if your Hearth was set there. If you have a Mage in group, kindly ask them for a portal to Ironforge \\ (Only if you turned in Kharan Mighthammer)
[OC][L 39.09,56.19 Ironforge]Talk to *King Magni Bronzebeard* \\ Turn in [QT4361 The Bearer of Bad News] \\ Accept [QA4362 The Fate of the Kingdom]
[OC]Hearth to Lakeshire if your Hearth is set there. Otherwise fly to Burning Steppes manually \\ Fly to [F]Burning Steppes \\ If you are already in the Burning Steppes, tick this travel step.
[O][L 84.55,68.68 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Oralius* \\ Turn in [QT4286 The Good Stuff]
[G 84.74,69.02 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Marshal Maxwell* \\ The quest chain will stop here until you find *A Crumpled Up Note* at BRD \\ Turn in [QT4242 Abandoned Hope]
[G 85.41,70.06 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Jalinda Sprig* \\ Turn in [QT4262 Overmaster Pyron] \\ Accept [QA4263 Incendius!]
[OC]Enter Blackrock Depths
[OC]Complete the Ring of Law boss event, then take the exit up the tunnel and immediately turn right, crossing up over the top of the Ring of Law, making your way to the Vault
Loot *The Heart of the Mountain* inside of the safe wall. It takes 15 seconds for it to respawn \\ There is a trick which allows you to loot it without having to open the safe. View the link below to see how it is done \\ [QC4123,1 The Heart of the Mountain] \\ Open Edit guide and copy the full URL to see how to loot the Heart of the Mountain: https://youtu.be/rg_UPmatbSw
[O]Kill *Dwarves* at BRD. Loot them for *A Crumpled Up Note* \\ Use *A Crumpled Up Note* to start the quest \\ It is important you do this before killing bosses *General Angerforge* and *Golem Lord Argelmach* \\ If you still have not found this by now clear around the Detention Block until it drops \\ Accept [QA4264 A Crumpled Up Note][UI11446-]
[O]Kill *Fineous Darkvire*. Loot him for the *Ironfel* \\ [QC3802,1 Dark Iron Legacy]
Kill *Lord Incendius* \\ [QC4263,1 Incendius!]
[O]Run back near the location above the Ring of Law \\ Click the *Monument of Franclorn Forgewright* \\ Turn in [QT3802 Dark Iron Legacy]
[O]Head to the Shadowforge Gates at the start of the entrance \\ Kill *Bael'Gar* \\ Use the *Altered Black Dragonflight Molt* on his corpse \\ [QC4024,1 A Taste of Flame][UI11231-]
Talk to *Marshal Windsor* \\ Turn in [QT4264 A Crumpled Up Note] \\ Accept [QA4282 A Shred of Hope]
Kill *General Angerforge* and *Golem Lord Argelmach*. Loot them both for *Marshal Windsor's Lost Information* \\ [QC4282,1 A Shred of Hope] \\ [QC4282,2 A Shred of Hope]
Talk to *Marshal Windsor* \\ ENSURE ALL PARTY MEMBERS HAVE AUTO ACCEPT OFF FOR THIS STEP! \\ Accepting this quest will begin the Jail Break escort. Ensure you have cleared all of the Detention Block area for an easier time escorting *Marshal Windsor* \\ Turn in [QT4282 A Shred of Hope] \\ Accept [QA4322 Jail Break!] \\ (Hold Shift at the NPC, or Guidelime accepts this quest at once)
Escort *Marshal Windsor* through BRD \\ [QC4322,1 Jail Break!]
In the Grim Guzzler, have your tank talk to *Ribbly Screwspigot* and pull him and his cronies into the keg room on the left. Avoid attacking neutral patrons. Kill *Ribbly Screwspigot* and loot his head. [QC4136,1 Ribbly Screwspigot]
In the Grim Guzzler's left-hand keg room, click the three *Thunderbrew Lager Kegs* to draw out *Hurley Blackbreath* and his three cronies. Kill Hurley and loot the *Lost Thunderbrew Recipe*. [QC4126,1 Hurley Blackbreath]
Loot the *Core Fragment* on the ground outside of the Molten Core instance portal \\ [QC7848,1 Attunement to the Core]
[OC]Kill *Emperor Dagran Thaurissan* \\ You must NOT kill *Princess Moira Bronzebeard* in order to complete and turn in this quest \\ Have a party member kite *Princess Moira Bronzebeard* while the rest of the group kills *Emperor Dagran Thaurissan* \\ [QC4362,1 The Fate of the Kingdom]
[OC]Talk to *Princess Moira Bronzebeard* \\ Turn in [QT4362 The Fate of the Kingdom] \\ Accept [QA4363 The Princess's Surprise]
[O][L 39.09,56.19 Ironforge]Travel to Ironforge. Hearth there if it is your home, or ask a Mage for a portal. Talk to *King Magni Bronzebeard* \\ Turn in [QT4363 The Princess's Surprise]
[OC]Travel to Kharanos. If convenient, hearth or take a portal to Ironforge first.
[G 46.83,52.36 Dun Morogh]Talk to *Ragnar Thunderbrew* \\ Turn in [QT4126 Hurley Blackbreath]
[OC]Hearth to Lakeshire if your Hearth is set there. Otherwise fly to Burning Steppes manually \\ Fly to [F]Burning Steppes \\ If you are already in the Burning Steppes, tick this travel step.
[O][L 84.55,68.68 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Oralius* \\ Turn in [QT4286 The Good Stuff]
[OC][G 84.74,69.02 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Marshal Maxwell* \\ Turn in [QT4322 Jail Break!] \\ Accept [QA6402 Stormwind Rendezvous]
[G 85.41,70.06 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Jalinda Sprig* \\ Turn in [QT4263 Incendius!]
[O][L 95.06,31.56 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Cyrus Therepentous* \\ Turn in [QT4024 A Taste of Flame]
[G 65.15,23.91 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Maxwort Uberglint* \\ Turn in [QT4123 The Heart of the Mountain]
[G 66.06,21.95 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Yuka Screwspigot* \\ Turn in [QT4136 Ribbly Screwspigot]
[OC][L 84.33,68.33 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Borgus Stoutarm* \\ Have a Mage port you if you have one in your group \\ Fly to [F]Stormwind \\ (If you skipped Jail Break! or the escort failed, skip this Stormwind trip and the Windsor chain below.)[TAR2299-]
[OC][G 73.61,91.05 Stormwind City]Talk to *Squire Rowe* and *Reginald Windsor* \\ *Squire Rowe* will call for *Reginald Windsor's* arrival after you talk to him at the Gates of Stormwind \\ IF YOU ARE IN A PARTY ENSURE NO ONE AUTO ACCEPTS The Great Masquerade. \\ Turn in [QT6402 Stormwind Rendezvous] \\ Accept [QA6403 The Great Masquerade] \\ (Hold Shift at the NPC, or Guidelime accepts this quest at once)
[OC][L 79.15,40.55 Stormwind City][L 78.45,39.22 Stormwind City]Escort *Reginald Windsor* into Stormwind Keep \\ Do not assist *Reginald Windsor* in combat while inside the Keep. If you do so there is a high chance you may die. Stay back at the arrow location and let the event finish on its own. It will take a few minutes \\ [QC6403,1 The Great Masquerade]
[OC][L 79.69,39.03 Stormwind City]Talk to *Highlord Bolvar Fordragon* \\ Turn in [QT6403 The Great Masquerade] \\ Accept [QA6501 The Dragon's Eye]
[G 26.4,24.45 Burning Steppes]Talk to *Lothos Riftwaker* \\ You can either turn this in now or the next time you are in Blackrock Mountain \\ Turn in [QT7848 Attunement to the Core]
Finish the existing Blackrock Depths visits, then tick this step to check the optional Dragon's Eye delivery below. Otherwise select another guide.
[A IT16662][O][G 56.60,52.78,50 Winterspring][G 56.36,53.60,30 Winterspring][G 55.31,53.84,20 Winterspring][G 54.78,53.30,20 Winterspring][G 54.51,53.44,20 Winterspring][G 54.14,52.84,10 Winterspring][G 53.73,52.04,10 Winterspring][G 54.54,51.21,30 Winterspring]Travel to Winterspring. Follow these mountain-path waypoints carefully, starting east of Mazthoril, to reach *Haleh* \\ Turn in [QT6501 The Dragon's Eye] \\ Avoid the blue circle beside Haleh: it teleports you into the cave with elite dragons. Tick this step off if you leave this delivery for later.
